sequenceDiagram
  participant A as PC 1 (192.168.1.10)
  participant LAN as LAN broadcast 255.255.255.255 / 192.168.1.255
  participant B as PC 2 (192.168.1.20)
  Note over A,B: Method 1 - UDP broadcast (port 50505)
  A->>LAN: "who-is-there" {id, name, port, fp}
  LAN->>B: deliver
  B-->>A: unicast beacon {id, name, port 5001, fp}
  loop every 3 seconds
    B->>LAN: beacon
    A->>LAN: beacon
  end
  Note over A,B: Method 2 - active subnet scan (Scan button)
  par 128 parallel workers over 192.168.1.1-254
    A->>B: TCP connect :5001 + "PING"
    B-->>A: {app:"SFT", name, port, fp}
  end
  Note over A: device list updated - online if seen < 15 s
  Note over A,B: Method 3 - user types the IP shown on PC 2 (manual)
